  chapters:
  - key: sapa
    title:
      id: Selamat datang
      en: Welcome
    text:
      id: Halo! Selamat datang di Candi Borobudur, candi Buddha terbesar di dunia.
        Model di depanmu dibuat dengan skala satu banding dua ratus. Aslinya, kaki
        candi berukuran seratus dua puluh tiga kali seratus dua puluh tiga meter,
        dan puncaknya menjulang tiga puluh lima meter dari tanah. Yuk, kita jelajahi
        bersama!
      en: Hi there! Welcome to Borobudur, the largest Buddhist temple in the world.
        The model in front of you is built at a scale of one to two hundred. The
        real base measures one hundred and twenty-three by one hundred and twenty-three
        metres, and its summit rises thirty-five metres above the ground. Let's explore
        it together!
    stage: 0
    focusHotspot: 
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0c87f09cf748ef44196c7865e59eac51, type: 3}
    voiceEN: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dff4aa46ff479f44181d63fa680610f9, type: 3}
    cuesID:
    - time: 0.1
      text: Halo!
    - time: 1.834
      text: Selamat datang di Candi Borobudur, candi Buddha terbesar di dunia.
    - time: 7.849
      text: Model di depanmu dibuat dengan skala satu banding dua ratus.
    - time: 13.162
      text: Aslinya, kaki candi berukuran seratus dua puluh tiga kali seratus dua
        puluh tiga meter, dan puncaknya menjulang tiga puluh lima meter dari tanah.
    - time: 24.295
      text: Yuk, kita jelajahi bersama!
