  - key: relief
    title:
      id: Galeri relief
      en: A gallery of reliefs
    text:
      id: Di atasnya berdiri lima teras persegi. Inilah Rupadhatu, alam berbentuk.
        Dinding lorongnya penuh relief, seluruhnya sekitar dua ribu enam ratus tujuh
        puluh dua panel. Relief dibaca sambil berjalan searah jarum jam, yang disebut
        pradaksina. Ada kisah hidup Sang Buddha dalam Lalitavistara, kisah kehidupan-kehidupan
        sebelumnya dalam Jataka dan Avadana, serta pengembaraan Sudhana mencari Kebijaksanaan
        Sempurna dalam Gandavyuha. Relief naratifnya terbentang sepanjang kira-kira
        tiga kilometer. Pada model ini reliefnya dibuat bergaya, bukan salinan relief
        asli.
      en: Above it stand five square terraces. This is Rupadhatu, the world of forms.
        The gallery walls are covered in reliefs, about two thousand six hundred
        and seventy-two panels in all. They are read while walking clockwise, which
        is called pradakshina. There is the life of the Buddha in the Lalitavistara,
        his former lives in the Jataka and Avadana, and Sudhana's search for Perfect
        Wisdom in the Gandavyuha. The narrative reliefs stretch for about three kilometres.
        On this model the reliefs are stylised, not copies of the real ones.
    stage: 0
    focusHotspot: relief
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e00f219595822d540818971dddc45be9, type: 3}
    voiceEN: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0024ca20fdaec6c43991c8874645a482, type: 3}
