  - key: stupa_induk
    title:
      id: Stupa induk
      en: The main stupa
    text:
      id: Sekarang kita bongkar dari puncak. Stupa induk diangkat. Inilah stupa terbesar
        sekaligus titik tertinggi candi, dan bagian dalamnya kosong. Dahulu puncaknya
        pernah dimahkotai chattra, payung batu bersusun tiga. Theodoor van Erp menyusunnya
        kembali saat pemugaran tahun 1907 sampai 1911, lalu membongkarnya lagi karena
        batu aslinya tidak cukup.
      en: Now let's take it apart from the top. The main stupa is lifted. This is
        the largest stupa and the highest point of the temple, and its interior is
        empty. Its summit was once crowned by a chattra, a three-tiered stone parasol.
        Theodoor van Erp rebuilt it during the restoration of 1907 to 1911, then
        dismantled it again because there were not enough original stones.
    stage: 1
    focusHotspot: stupa_induk
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a24c15e57ec24da45992f06b60e7cf51, type: 3}
    voiceEN: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d3dee504c685a694893b8fcc0365e689, type: 3}
    cuesID:
